# Use an HTTP client supporting .http files; replace placeholders locally.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@citizenToken = REPLACE_CITIZEN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@staffToken = REPLACE_STAFF_ACCESS_TOKEN
@complaintId = REPLACE_COMPLAINT_ID
@departmentId = REPLACE_DEPARTMENT_ID

### Register citizen (use your own password; sample is not a deployed credential)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Your Name","email":"citizen@example.test","password":"REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PASSWORD"}

### Log in as an existing account
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"citizen@example.test","password":"REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PASSWORD"}

### Submit a complaint; replace sample coordinates with actual village location
POST {{base}}/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Water supply interruption","description":"Water supply has stopped on this street since yesterday.","category":"water","location":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[77.2,28.6]}}

### Citizen tracking
GET {{base}}/complaints
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Fetch current version before any update
GET {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify (replace version with current value)
POST {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":0,"remarks":"Issue verified"}

### Assign (department must support category)
POST {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"departmentId":"{{departmentId}}"}

### Start work
POST {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2}

### Upload evidence with your client: multipart field image, no other fields
# POST {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}/attachments
# Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
# Reload complaint afterward to get the incremented version.

### Resolve after successful evidence upload; replace version as needed
POST {{base}}/complaints/{{complaintId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":4,"remarks":"Supply restored after repairing the valve"}

### Admin overview
GET {{base}}/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Citizen notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications?unread=true
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
